{"type":"standard","title":"Tobo-Kube language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Tobo-Kube language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q11732359","titles":{"canonical":"Tobo-Kube_language","normalized":"Tobo-Kube language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Tobo-Kube language</span></span>"},"pageid":32639875,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1330693666","tid":"ad1580d4-e767-11f0-9c15-6460b00337fb","timestamp":"2026-01-01T23:14:52Z","description":"Papuan language","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobo-Kube_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobo-Kube_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobo-Kube_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Tobo-Kube_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobo-Kube_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Tobo-Kube_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobo-Kube_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Tobo-Kube_language"}},"extract":"Kube (Hube) and Tobo, also Mongi, are a Papuan language spoken in Morobe Province, Papua New Guinea. They are mutually intelligible and 95% lexicostatistically cognate. Dialects of Kube include Kurungtufu and Yoangen (Yoanggeng).","extract_html":"<p><b>Kube</b> (Hube) and <b>Tobo</b>, also <i>Mongi</i>, are a Papuan language spoken in Morobe Province, Papua New Guinea. They are mutually intelligible and 95% lexicostatistically cognate. Dialects of Kube include <i>Kurungtufu</i> and <i>Yoangen</i> (<i>Yoanggeng</i>).</p>"}